<Routines>
<Routine Name="a1_MainRoutine" Type="RLL">
<RLLContent>
<Rung Number="0" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[
All information provided  - No Warranty or implied merchantability. 
Refer to the RSLogix 5000 End User License Agreement (EULA) in the Release Notes.

]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[NOP();]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="1" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[[JSR(a2_PICK_PLACE,0) ,JSR(a3_JogMaster,0) ];]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
</RLLContent>
</Routine>
<Routine Name="a2_PICK_PLACE" Type="RLL">
<RLLContent>
<Rung Number="0" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(s:fs)MOV(-1,step);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="1" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Home the Joint axes before initiating MCTO]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(MotionGroup.GroupSynced)EQU(step,-1)[MAH(J1,mah1) MAH(J2,mah2) MAH(J3,mah3) MAH(J6,mah4) ,XIC(mah1.PC) XIC(mah2.PC) XIC(mah3.PC) XIC(mah4.PC) MOV(1,step) ];]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="2" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Enable MCTO followed by Motion Coordinated Master Driven Speed Control for controlling the speed of the PICK PLACE through single virtual master]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[EQU(step,1)[MCTO(CS_XYZRxRyRz,Delta4Axis,mctoInstruction,0,0) XIC(mctoInstruction.IP) MDCC(CS_XYZRxRyRz,VirtualMaster,mdccInstruction,Command,nominal_master_vel) ,XIC(mdccInstruction.IP) MOV(2,step) ];]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="3" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[============Simple PICK AND PLACE Moves  with Rz orientation control ================]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[EQU(step,2)[MCPM(CS_XYZRxRyRz,mcpm[0],path[0],1,dyn_data,0,Immediate Forward Only) ,XIC(mcpm[0].IP) XIO(CS_XYZRxRyRz.MovePendingQueueFullStatus) MOV(3,step) ];]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="4" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[EQU(step,3)[MCPM(CS_XYZRxRyRz,mcpm[1],path[1],1,dyn_data,0,Immediate Forward Only) ,XIC(mcpm[1].IP) XIO(CS_XYZRxRyRz.MovePendingQueueFullStatus) MOV(4,step) ];]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="5" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[EQU(step,4)[MCPM(CS_XYZRxRyRz,mcpm[2],path[2],1,dyn_data,0,Immediate Forward Only) ,XIC(mcpm[2].IP) XIO(CS_XYZRxRyRz.MovePendingQueueFullStatus) MOV(5,step) ];]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="6" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[EQU(step,5)[MCPM(CS_XYZRxRyRz,mcpm[3],path[3],1,dyn_data,0,Immediate Forward Only) ,XIC(mcpm[3].IP) XIO(CS_XYZRxRyRz.MovePendingQueueFullStatus) MOV(6,step) ];]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="7" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[EQU(step,6)[MCPM(CS_XYZRxRyRz,mcpm[4],path[4],1,dyn_data,0,Immediate Forward Only) ,XIC(mcpm[4].IP) XIO(CS_XYZRxRyRz.MovePendingQueueFullStatus) MOV(7,step) ];]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="8" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[EQU(step,7)[MCPM(CS_XYZRxRyRz,mcpm[5],path[5],1,dyn_data,0,Immediate Forward Only) ,XIC(mcpm[5].IP) XIO(CS_XYZRxRyRz.MovePendingQueueFullStatus) MOV(8,step) ];]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="9" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[EQU(step,8)[MCPM(CS_XYZRxRyRz,mcpm[6],path[6],1,dyn_data,0,Immediate Forward Only) ,XIC(mcpm[6].PC) XIO(CS_XYZRxRyRz.MovePendingQueueFullStatus) MOV(3,step) ];]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
</RLLContent>
</Routine>
<Routine Name="a3_JogMaster" Type="RLL">
<RLLContent>
<Rung Number="0" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIO(maj1.EN)MAJ(VirtualMaster,maj1,0,majMaster,0,100,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
</RLLContent>
</Routine>
<Routine Name="readme_file" Type="ST">
<STContent>
<Line Number="0">
<![CDATA[]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="1">
<![CDATA[(*]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="2">
<![CDATA[ /*  ============================================================================= */	]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="3">
<![CDATA[				  DELTA 4 Axis Robot with Orientation Control   ]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="4">
<![CDATA[ /*  ============================================================================= */	]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="5">
<![CDATA[]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="6">
<![CDATA[This program contains a 4-Axis Delta Robot demonstrating a simple PICK and PLACE in XZ plane with Rz orientation control.]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="7">
<![CDATA[It also demonstrates the Speed override functionality (scaling the entire PICK and PLACE dynamics using a single master axis).]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="8">
<![CDATA[]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="9">
<![CDATA[]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="10">
<![CDATA[a2_PICK_PLACE routine overview: ]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="11">
<![CDATA[]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="12">
<![CDATA[1. MCTO links the Cartesian XYZRxRyRz and Delta-4Axis Robot Coordinate systems (Coordinate Definition for Delta 4 Axis is J1J2J3J6) and transforms the motion]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="13">
<![CDATA[2. MDCC is the master driven speed control instruction that links the Cartesian coordinate system to the virtual master axis for speed override functionality.]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="14">
<![CDATA[3. Using MCPM Path move instruction, the Robot is programmed to move to a known Absolute Start Position. ]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="15">
<![CDATA[4. Rest of the PICK moves are incremental moves with 150 Up followed by 400 horizontal and 150 down in YZ plane. ]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="16">
<![CDATA[   The same is repeated in the reverse direction for the PLACE move in YZ plane.]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="17">
<![CDATA[   Along with the Cartesian moves, the Path moves are also programmed with Rz orientation. ]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="18">
<![CDATA[]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="19">
<![CDATA[					 __________________________  ]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="20">
<![CDATA[				  B |            600           | C]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="21">
<![CDATA[				300 |                          |  300]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="22">
<![CDATA[					|                          |]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="23">
<![CDATA[				  A |                          | D    ]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="24">
<![CDATA[]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="25">
<![CDATA[5. The Rz Orientation moves are programmed incremental along with the primary cartesian axes as below:]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="26">
<![CDATA[	AB =   0 degrees]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="27">
<![CDATA[	BC =   0 degrees]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="28">
<![CDATA[	CD =   50 degrees]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="29">
<![CDATA[	DC =   0 degrees]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="30">
<![CDATA[	CB =  -50 degrees]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="31">
<![CDATA[	BA =   0 degrees   ]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="32">
<![CDATA[]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="33">
<![CDATA[6. The command tolerance for the first move is set to 100 units and the second move is set to 50  units for the PICK cycle.]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="34">
<![CDATA[   So when the AB move reaches 200 units from the start, it starts blending with BC move. ]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="35">
<![CDATA[   ]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="36">
<![CDATA[7. The dynamics of the path move are all programmed in % of max (dyn_data.UnitsMode  is set to 0). ]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="37">
<![CDATA[	Based on the configured Nominal Master velocity, the path move peak vector velocity can reach up to 64 units/sec]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="38">
<![CDATA[	Below is the calculation:]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="39">
<![CDATA[	Nominal Master Velocity = 50. The programmed MAJ Speed is 40 Units/sec. So the % of actual master velocity w.r.t Nominal master velocity is (40/50) *100 = 80%]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="40">
<![CDATA[	Programmed MCPM path slave velocity = 80% of Maximum and Actual Master velocity is 80% of the maximum, so the final velocity is 64% of its maximum.]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="41">
<![CDATA[	The configured Cartesian coordinate system Maximum Speed value is 100. So, the final slave velocity in Units/sec would be (64/100) * 100 = 64 unit/sec.]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="42">
<![CDATA[]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="43">
<![CDATA[a3_JogMaster routine overview:]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="44">
<![CDATA[1.	Jogging the VirtualMaster axis using MAJ instruction will provide the speed override functionality for the PICK and PLACE cycle.]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="45">
<![CDATA[]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="46">
<![CDATA[VectorDynamics. MainRoutine Overview:]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="47">
<![CDATA[1. The routine calculates the Cartesian Vector velocity and the Orientation vector velocity.]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="48">
<![CDATA[]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="49">
<![CDATA[]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="50">
<![CDATA[See  online help 'Blending Path Moves with MCPM for more information on the PICK and PLACE Cycle']]>
</Line>
<Line Number="51">
<![CDATA[*)]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="52">
<![CDATA[]]>
</Line>
</STContent>
</Routine>
</Routines>
</Program>
<Program Name="VectorDynamics" TestEdits="false" MainRoutineName="MainRoutine" Disabled="false">
<Tags/>
<Routines>
<Routine Name="MainRoutine" Type="RLL">
<RLLContent>
<Rung Number="0" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[CPT(OrtVectorVelocity,SQR( Rx.ActualVelocity**2 + Ry.ActualVelocity**2+ Rz.ActualVelocity**2))CPT(CartVectorVelocity,SQR(X.ActualVelocity**2 + Y.ActualVelocity**2+Z.ActualVelocity**2));]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
</RLLContent>
</Routine>
</Routines>
</Program>
</Programs>
<Tasks>
<Task Name="MainTask" Type="CONTINUOUS" Priority="10" Watchdog="500" DisableUpdateOutputs="false" InhibitTask="false">
<ScheduledPrograms>
<ScheduledProgram Name="MainProgram"/>
</ScheduledPrograms>
</Task>
<Task Name="MotionEventTask" Type="EVENT" Rate="10" Priority="10" Watchdog="500" DisableUpdateOutputs="true" InhibitTask="false">
<EventInfo EventTrigger="Motion Group Execution" EventTag="MotionGroup" EnableTimeout="false"/>
<ScheduledPrograms>
<ScheduledProgram Name="VectorDynamics"/>
</ScheduledPrograms>
</Task>
